OL,3,AHow a BBC strike exterminated Doctor
OL,4,AWho adventure
OL,5,
OL,6,FFor more than six decades, Doctor Who
OL,7,Fhas taken viewers across time and
OL,8,Fspace.
OL,10,FBut hidden within the show's history
OL,11,Fare unfinished episodes recorded in
OL,12,FCambridge.
OL,14,FIn 1979, production teams arrived in
OL,15,Fthe university city following a
OL,16,Fstoryline called 'Shada', written by
OL,17,Flocal author Douglas Adams - featuring
OL,18,FTom Baker as the fourth Doctor.
OL,20,FHowever, not everything went smoothly
OL,21,Fduring the shoot.
